Rituals are durable Blood Sorcery preparations, not instant powers. Preparing
requires attuned Blood Sorcery, Vitae, an open slot, no combat, and an approved
anchor such as the Covenant's Red Chapel or coffin vault.

  |GKBritual prepare <name>|000
  |GKBritual invoke <name> [target]|000

Invocation consumes one prepared use. Prepared uses survive logout and remort.

